            "body": "@chaunceyjiang Thanks for the pointer , I can see the new Parser Engine exists (gemma4/minimax_m2/nemotron_v3/qwen3 are on it), but I don't see an existing effort tracking migration of hunyuan_a13b/xlam to it. Is that migration something you'd want done as a prerequisite for this fix, or would it be fine to land this minimal correctness fix now and track the engine migration as separate follow-up work? Happy to help with the migration too if that's the preferred path and it's not already being planned by someone else.\r\n\r\n",
            "createdAt": "2026-07-27T07:02:30Z",
            "databaseId": 5088267577,
            "updatedAt": "2026-07-27T07:02:30Z",
            "url": "https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/49535#issuecomment-5088267577"
          },
