            },
            "body": "I think we should prioritize the migration. As far as I know, no one is currently working on it.",
            "createdAt": "2026-07-27T07:06:15Z",
            "databaseId": 5088301287,
            "updatedAt": "2026-07-27T07:06:15Z",
            "url": "https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/49535#issuecomment-5088301287"
